+as well as from seminar participants at Columbia University, the California Institute of Technology, and
+the NBER Summer Institute. Special thanks to Kyle Myers and Pierre Azoulay for their help with NIH
+grant data as well as their valuable comments. Stephanie Khoury and Tarikua Erda provided excellent
+research assistance. We particularly want to acknowledge the late Jordan Louviere, who shared sage advice
+on experimental design issues before his untimely death. All errors are our own.
